  "description": "Discover the luxury of Indian cuisine at Varq, an exquisite fine-dining restaurant at Taj Exotica Resort & Spa, The Palm, Dubai. Celebrated as one of the premier Indian restaurants in Dubai, Varq sets itself apart by infusing modern flair into its culinary offerings, featuring edible gold or silver leaf as a nod to the opulence of traditional Indian royalty. Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of shimmering gold and silver décor, where our show kitchen provides a captivating glimpse into the artistry of our master chefs. Varq’s culinary experts skillfully blend contemporary elements with the authentic flavours of Indian spices, showcasing their expertise in reimagining classic Indian delicacies.",
